# Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar's +2 covers "a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control", herself included. With the
# same turns as the transform scenario, Bot2's Llanowar Elves attacks Tamiyo on turn 4 and is weakened to 0 power: her loyalty stays 4 (the
# ? check). On turn 6, her next turn having come and gone without another +2, the Elves deal their 1 to her: loyalty 3.
[Bot1 Deck]
Island x3
Tamiyo, Inquisitive Student
Ponder
Brainstorm
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x2
Llanowar Elves
Forest x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tamiyo, Inquisitive Student.Cast
[Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ponder.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brainstorm.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar.Activate(Ability: Until your next turn)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar.Counters.Loyalty = 4
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar.Counters.Loyalty = 4
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar)
[T6 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar.Counters.Loyalty = 3
